<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Please do not reply to this email. This system cannot receive messages.</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">The corrective action '${number}' must be assigned</span></p>
<p>A health and safety hazard has been identified during a monthly workplace health and safety inspection and requires your immediate attention.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Name of inspector: ${parent.subject_person}</p>
<p>Other inspector(s): ${mail_script:hoc_ohsm_generate_inspectors_list}</p>
<p>Location: ${wi_location}</p>
<p>Hazard: &nbsp;${wi_hazard}</p>
