<p>Recommended action from WHSC, if any: ${wi_action_taken}</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Please click here to access the workplace inspection report and action your items within the specified timeline above.</p>
<p>Please open the following <a href="${mail_script:x_hccc_hoc_ohs_inv_case_link}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">link</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div>
<p><strong>Occupational Health and Safety</strong></p>
<p>House of Commons</p>
<p>50 O&rsquo;Connor, 8<span data-fontsize="11">th</span> floor <br>Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</p>
<p><a href="mailto:OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">OHS-SST@parl.gc.ca</a></p>
<p>Office: 613-995-3614</p>
</div>
<hr noshade="noshade">
<p><span style="font-family: 'calibri light'; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">AVIS</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Pri&egrave;re de ne pas r&eacute;pondre au pr&eacute;sent courriel, car il provient d&rsquo;une adresse qui ne peut pas recevoir de messages.</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">L&rsquo;action corrective '${number}' doit &ecirc;tre assign&eacute;e</span></p>
<p>Un danger pour la sant&eacute; et la s&eacute;curit&eacute; a &eacute;t&eacute; identifi&eacute; lors d'une inspection mensuelle de la sant&eacute; et de la s&eacute;curit&eacute; au travail et n&eacute;cessite votre attention imm&eacute;diate.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
